        },
        {
          "title": "Calculate volume",
          "body": "So the volume of solid S is\n\n\\[\n\\pi x^3+\\frac23\\pi x^3=\\frac53\\pi x^3\n\\]"
        },
        {
          "title": "Calculate volume",
          "body": "The sphere has radius \\(kx\\), so its volume is\n\n\\[\n\\frac43\\pi(kx)^3=\\frac43\\pi k^3x^3\n\\]"
